🎓 WHEN TO USE LOGISTIC REGRESSION

USE LOGISTIC REGRESSION IF:
  ✓ Binary classification problem (2 classes)
  ✓ Need interpretable results
  ✓ Linear decision boundary
  ✓ Small to medium dataset
  ✓ Need probabilities (confidence scores)
  ✓ Fast training required
  ✓ Limited computational resources
  ✓ No prior ML experience (good baseline)

DON'T USE IF:
  ✗ Complex non-linear patterns
  ✗ High-dimensional data (images, text)
  ✗ Need multi-class classification only (use One-vs-Rest)
  ✗ Very large dataset (consider SGD)
  ✗ Need state-of-the-art performance

