1️⃣6️⃣  EARLY STOPPING: Prevent Overfitting During Training
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

What is Early Stopping?
  → Stop training when validation error starts increasing
  → Prevents model from memorizing data

How It Works:
  1. Monitor validation error during training
  2. Save model when validation error is best
  3. If no improvement for N epochs → STOP
  4. Use saved best model (not final model)

Benefits:
  ✓ Prevents overfitting automatically
  ✓ Saves computation time
  ✓ Simple to implement
  ✓ Works great with neural networks
  ✓ No additional hyperparameter tuning needed

