3️⃣7️⃣  INTERVIEW DAY TIPS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

BEFORE INTERVIEW:

□ Research company
  • What ML problems do they solve?
  • Which models/tools do they use?
  • Recent ML projects/blogs?

□ Practice interview questions
  • Record yourself answering
  • Discuss with friends
  • Time your answers (2-3 mins per Q)

□ Prepare project deep-dive
  • You WILL be asked about projects
  • Know every detail
  • Have metrics/visualizations ready
  • Practice explaining like non-technical person

□ Know your "Why"
  • Why ML?
  • Why this company?
  • What excites you?

DURING INTERVIEW:

✅ Structure your answers
  • Take 5 seconds to think
  • Answer with framework: Problem → Solution → Result
  • Give examples from projects

✅ Show thinking process
  • "I would first understand the problem..."
  • "Let me think about the tradeoffs..."
  • Employers like seeing your thought process

✅ Admit when you don't know
  • "I haven't worked with that, but I would..."
  • "Good question, let me think..."
  • Better than BS'ing!

✅ Ask good questions
  • "What's the main ML challenge here?"
  • "What's the tech stack?"
  • "How do you handle model updates?"
  • Shows genuine interest

AFTER INTERVIEW:

✓ Send thank you email
✓ Mention something specific
✓ Reiterate interest
✓ Keep it brief (1 paragraph)

